Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.73,0:00:05.21,Text,All,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.02,0:00:08.63,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,莉莉同學 妳是第一次泡溫泉嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:11.67,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯 和大家一起泡澡 感覺好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:12.77,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,快進去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:13.57,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:24.99,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:27.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不 沒什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:36.98,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個… 我有好好跟伯母說過了…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:38.81,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,那種事我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:43.08,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,伯父 絕對還在生氣吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.57,0:00:45.06,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,話說回來…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:48.75,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,他到底是做什麼工作的啊…？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.03,0:00:51.27,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,蓮司君
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.27,0:00:52.66,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:56.81,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你是把我當成熊了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:00:59.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 那時候真的很抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:01.40,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,不 我不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:05.02,Top,Oliver,0,0,0,,被誤認成熊 反倒是我的榮幸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:10.17,Top,Oliver,0,0,0,,我想問的是… 你當時為什麼沒有逃走？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.17,0:01:13.80,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦…？ 不… 因為大家都在啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.01,0:01:18.54,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,哼 你是說你是為了保護大家 才挺身而出的嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:20.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒那麼誇張啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.72,0:01:23.42,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我當時奮不顧身 根本沒想那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:38.90,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,蓮司君
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:40.20,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 是？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:43.89,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,我一直想… 找個機會好好問你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:48.20,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你對莉莉是怎麼想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.55,0:01:51.71,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦…？ 您怎麼突然問這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:52.93,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:01:58.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:01.25,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 和莉莉是同樣的顏色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:13.99,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哇！ 好多人！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.99,0:02:13.99,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,So many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.99,0:02:16.08,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,蓮君 蓮君！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:16.99,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:20.99,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,幫我擦防曬乳啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.99,0:02:23.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳是從哪裡學來這種話的啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:26.13,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,而且日葵 妳不是已經曬得夠黑了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.13,0:02:27.99,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,沒差啦 小氣鬼！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:32.56,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司！ 也幫我擦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:33.51,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.51,0:02:36.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不… 這也有點…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.74,0:02:39.58,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊啊真是的 我來幫妳擦！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:42.39,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那… 說的也是 我去買點喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.39,0:02:43.60,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊 蓮司！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:44.72,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,蓮君！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.49,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,看招！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:36.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,好 那我們來吃西瓜吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.85,0:03:38.30,Text,Aoi & Himari & Lily,0,0,0,,耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:48.57,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.50,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個是「鹿踊」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:53.09,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是模仿鹿的舞蹈服裝喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.57,0:03:56.30,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,鹿踊？ Deer？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:59.02,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒錯 牠們是神明的使者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:02.80,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,對了！ 莉莉 妳不是說過在來這裡的火車上 有看到鹿嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.80,0:04:04.02,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:13.30,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,既然遇到了神明的使者 一定會有好事發生的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:14.81,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 的確！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:16.82,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:19.11,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,那待會見囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:20.66,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,待會見！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.11,0:04:20.66,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:25.07,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,我回來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.87,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.44,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,不行啊 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:33.07,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,上游只有小溪流而已 都只有這種小隻的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.07,0:04:33.75,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.45,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,哎呀 不好意思喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:38.14,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:41.68,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,沒… 沒事…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:44.47,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,我來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:46.56,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,走吧 去祭典囉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.71,0:04:48.58,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.58,0:04:49.91,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,妳在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:50.80,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:52.70,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我現在… 就去準備…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:56.87,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.27,0:05:00.66,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？ 會不會很奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.82,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,很適合妳喔 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:05.78,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,哎呀 看來大家都準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:07.10,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,鏘！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.10,0:05:08.41,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:10.79,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:11.78,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:12.88,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,妳看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.45,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊！ 是男子漢貓咪！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.45,0:05:18.43,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,我準備回老家的時候 不知怎麼就翻到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.91,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,咦？ 那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.91,0:05:22.04,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 我也有戴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:23.76,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我們戴一樣的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.76,0:05:25.05,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.95,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,欸 好棒喔 我也想要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:31.06,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,不可能了吧？ 這都幾年前的東西了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:32.43,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,不知道耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.06,0:05:40.00,High,Lily,0,0,0,,現在先去佔個看煙火的好位置吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.06,0:05:40.00,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Now, let's save a good spot for the fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.00,0:05:41.19,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,馬上就要去！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:44.79,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,煙火是不錯 但得先享受祭典才行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.70,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,對啊 我們去逛祭典吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:47.82,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,一定很好玩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:52.21,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,可是不早點去的話 好位子會被搶走…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:57.04,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 難不成妳還在在意 昨天奶奶說的那個故事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.34,0:06:11.39,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒問題啦 煙火要晚上才開始
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:14.35,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,而且祭典還有廟會可以逛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,有蘋果糖和炒麵之類的…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.56,0:06:17.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蘋果糖！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.97,0:06:19.88,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:20.60,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:23.61,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好！ 那就先去吃蘋果糖吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.11,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,Uh... no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.35,0:06:28.95,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,廟會… 我想去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.00,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,好！ 那大家一起去逛吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:32.62,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,走吧走吧！ 莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:34.03,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊… 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.40,0:06:53.06,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,欸 那個是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:56.67,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉 跑太前面會迷路喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:59.98,High,Lily,0,0,0,,我沒事的！ 我已經不是小孩子了！
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.11,0:06:59.98,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,I'll be fine! I'm not a child anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:18.86,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哇啊！ 是鹿踊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.62,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.87,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,莉莉 妳知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:23.38,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,That's deer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:24.63,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,那個是鹿喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:26.00,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:29.44,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,哎呀呀 莉莉 妳真是聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.64,0:07:38.78,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,總覺得讓我想起了「蓋福克斯之夜」呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:39.54,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.39,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,蓋… 什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:44.48,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,蓋福克斯之夜 是英國的祭典喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:45.14,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.34,0:07:51.65,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,這個「鹿踊」想必也是自古以來 就在這片土地上扎根的傳統吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.65,0:07:53.49,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,不 這可不一定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:54.16,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:08:00.25,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,這個祭典是從外地來的人們 一起帶來的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:02.50,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,在和那些人交流的過程中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:06.05,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,不知不覺間 這一帶也開始跳這種舞了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:13.17,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,所謂的傳統啊 就是這樣透過異文化交流而誕生的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:16.02,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,再與其他文化交融… 如此傳承下去的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:30.68,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,是男子漢無尾熊君！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.94,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哦 真不愧是人氣商品
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.94,0:08:34.55,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,莉莉 想要嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.55,0:08:35.20,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:38.96,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,那我們輪流玩 看誰先套中就算誰贏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.33,High,Lily,0,0,0,,放馬過來！
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.33,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.69,0:08:44.95,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,又開始對決了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.84,0:08:50.54,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,完全… 套不進去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:53.15,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,好！ 還沒完呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.15,0:08:53.90,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:55.85,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,等一下等一下！ 我來！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:58.21,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好厲害！ 是頭獎！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:08:59.35,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:01.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那這個就給莉莉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.41,0:09:02.57,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:05.68,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,欸 太偏心了！ 也給我一個什麼嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:07.42,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那去玩那邊的射擊遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.11,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,哦 射擊遊戲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:12.01,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,那個的話 我還算有點心得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.01,0:09:14.95,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,蓮司君 要不要和我比一場？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.95,0:09:16.35,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.10,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗯…？ 搞什麼鬼
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.92,0:09:26.10,Text-English,Oliver,0,0,0,,Huh...? bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.14,0:09:34.18,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,中了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:36.12,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司好厲害！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.63,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是我贏了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.95,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,那是什麼鬼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:40.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.06,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,有這種射法嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.06,0:09:44.91,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不 這個本來就是要這樣射的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:46.78,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,570)}真是的 爸爸別鬧了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:48.64,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,給妳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:50.02,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:53.15,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,葵衣有什麼想要的東西 也儘管說喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:55.82,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:06.04,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,煙火 煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.04,0:10:08.04,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？ 莉莉的束口袋呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:08.78,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.87,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我忘記了！ 我去拿！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.87,0:10:13.54,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,等… 莉莉！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.16,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她一個人沒問題嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.16,0:10:17.49,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,怎麼了 葵衣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:18.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.04,0:10:22.69,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,莉莉說要回去拿忘記的東西 一個人跑回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:25.17,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:34.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,我會把莉莉帶回來 葵衣妳先去跟大家說一聲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.41,0:10:35.40,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:38.55,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒問題的 包在哥哥身上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:50.17,High,Lily,0,0,0,,太好了…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.50,0:10:50.17,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:54.21,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.27,0:11:18.49,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,妳說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.73,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,所以我哥哥現在去找她了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.73,0:11:23.73,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,不… 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:26.75,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒問題的 因為有哥哥在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:29.53,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,我去找他們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.53,0:11:30.14,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.14,0:11:33.02,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,這座神社 我從小時候就常來玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:34.38,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,啊 說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:36.00,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,大家先過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:36.79,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:38.89,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,拜託妳了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:40.44,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.44,0:11:41.88,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,路上小心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:43.38,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:46.99,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,那我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.99,0:11:47.56,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.38,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:51.02,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,要讓奶奶她們 在那邊一直等嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.02,0:11:52.86,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,話是這麼說沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:54.36,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,沒問題的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:58.11,Flashback,Oliver,0,0,0,,你對莉莉是怎麼想的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.02,Flashback,Oliver,0,0,0,,回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:09.42,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,說實話… 我還不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:16.12,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉對我抱有好感 這點我非常開心… 但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.12,0:12:20.82,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,這份心意在未來會不會一直不變
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:24.28,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,還是說 總有一天會改變呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:29.97,Flashback,Sheryl,0,0,0,,莉莉以後也拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:34.75,Flashback,Aoi,0,0,0,,只有讓莉莉傷心這件事 你絕對不准做喔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.44,0:12:42.06,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,不過… 就算真是那樣 我也不會讓莉莉傷心的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.93,0:12:45.17,Flashback,Oliver,0,0,0,,那是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:46.31,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？ 欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:49.81,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,咦 我說錯了嗎？ 咦… 我又搞砸了嗎…？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:09.38,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,沒事的！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.84,0:13:09.38,Flashback-English,Lily,0,0,0,,It's all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.14,0:13:17.81,Flashback,Oliver,0,0,0,,我懂了… 不對…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:20.38,Flashback,Oliver,0,0,0,,我懂的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:26.08,Flashback,Oliver,0,0,0,,蓮司君 莉莉以後 就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:28.43,Flashback,Renji,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:37.58,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:17.76,Text,Dancer,0,0,0,,哎呀 嚇我一跳 妳還好嗎？ 站得起來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.32,0:15:42.65,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:52.14,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.53,0:15:54.04,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司…？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:16.40,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.41,0:16:21.61,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.61,0:16:24.91,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊 對不起 我只是想起了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.37,0:16:29.76,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,我們剛認識的時候 我去問你對留言卡的答覆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.37,0:16:36.18,Comment,Lily,0,0,0,,※ 指第一集時的那張「Be My Valentine!」的卡片
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:32.67,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,一見到蓮司 我就不知道該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.18,0:16:36.18,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,結果就突然逃走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.04,0:16:38.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,哈哈… 的確有這回事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.72,0:16:42.84,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司卻追上來抓住了 那樣的我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:44.30,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那時候很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.05,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,不 沒事的
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.05,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.56,0:16:53.06,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,在我迷惘的時候 蓮司總會找到我 並抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.06,0:16:55.20,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,沒有那回事啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:59.45,High,Lily,0,0,0,,就像我們第一次見面時一樣！
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.66,0:16:59.45,High-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Like the first time we met!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:03.32,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,從那之後 已經過了半年了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.70,0:17:04.86,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,蓮司
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:05.58,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:10.25,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,從那天起 我的心意就沒有變過
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.25,0:17:12.06,Flashback,Lily,0,0,0,,謝謝你 我會好好珍惜的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.25,0:17:12.06,Flashback-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Thank you. I will cherish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:17.09,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,Renji, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:20.60,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:22.46,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.46,0:17:24.23,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,日葵 妳… 妳怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:25.94,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,我很擔心妳耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:27.60,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥… 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.95,0:17:32.19,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,結果大家還是都跑來找人了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.43,0:17:34.07,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,大家是指…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:35.19,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.01,0:17:40.84,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,那個啊 葵衣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.84,0:17:41.45,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.45,0:17:43.62,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳們是從什麼時候開始看的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.46,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:48.15,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,哦 草壁先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:52.50,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,你找到我的女兒 我打從心底感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.50,0:17:55.03,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.33,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,啊… 不會…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:57.29,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,好了 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.29,0:18:00.37,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,爸爸買了煙火 我們回去大家一起放吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:01.46,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,啊… 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:06.06,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,哥哥 總覺得很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:06.72,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:10.99,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,妳在說什麼啊 這又不是葵衣該道歉的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.17,0:18:18.45,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,不過… 要是大家沒來的話 不知道會變成怎樣呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.54,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,這就是最後一根了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:39.22,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.37,0:19:11.20,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.32,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,燙！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.53,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,爸… 爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:15.92,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,等一下 你在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.41,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,快點冰敷 快點冰敷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:20.92,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,這次真的 受你們照顧了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:22.18,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,哪裡哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.18,0:19:23.72,Text,Grandma,0,0,0,,莉莉 歡迎再來玩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.72,0:19:24.48,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:27.02,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,下次換我去妳們那邊玩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:28.61,Text,Himari,0,0,0,,到時候再來比一場！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:30.61,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,正合我意！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.31,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,她們兩個的感情真好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.31,0:19:34.47,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.56,0:19:36.54,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,再見啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:38.24,Text,Hotaru,0,0,0,,莉莉同學 再見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:39.73,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:41.02,Text,Aoi,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:42.62,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,再見 葵衣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:45.36,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,待會見 莉莉
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.13,0:19:45.36,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,See you later, Lily-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.63,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,下次再見 蓮司
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.63,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,See you again, Renji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.53,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,下次再見
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.53,Text-English,Renji,0,0,0,,See you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:53.32,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:59.95,Text,Karin,0,0,0,,什麼 see you again 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:02.24,Text,Renji,0,0,0,,有什麼關係嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.77,0:20:05.26,Text,Kaede,0,0,0,,好了好了 我們也該回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:15.23,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,你還好嗎？ 要不要換我開一段路？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.27,0:20:15.23,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Are you all right? Do you want me to drive for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.31,0:20:15.78,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:18.91,High,Oliver,0,0,0,,沒問題的 我很好！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.27,0:20:18.91,High-English,Oliver,0,0,0,,It's all right. I'm perfectly fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:20.69,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.82,0:20:20.69,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:27.91,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,經過這次旅行 我好像知道 為什麼你這麼喜歡這裡了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.95,0:20:27.91,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Through this trip, I think I've figured out why you seem to like this place so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:30.70,High,Oliver,0,0,0,,哦 真的嗎？ 說來聽聽？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.20,0:20:30.70,High-English,Oliver,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Care to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.46,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,因為這裡是靠左行駛的！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.46,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,It's because we drive on the left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:37.43,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.05,High,Oliver,0,0,0,,原來妳發現了啊！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.05,High-English,Oliver,0,0,0,,So, you've figured it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.15,0:20:44.53,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,噓！ 小聲點！
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.15,0:20:44.53,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Shh! Keep it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:45.05,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.60,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,祝妳好夢
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.22,0:20:47.60,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.47,0:20:49.85,High,Sheryl,0,0,0,,我們的小天使
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.47,0:20:49.85,High-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Our little angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:53.92,Flashback,Aoi (Age 8),0,0,0,,哥哥 幫我夾那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.92,0:20:56.99,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,咦… 這種東西到處都有賣吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:20:58.15,Flashback,Aoi (Age 8),0,0,0,,不行啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.15,0:21:00.70,Flashback,Aoi (Age 8),0,0,0,,這是遊樂場的獎品 買不到的啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:01.61,Flashback,Aoi (Age 8),0,0,0,,拜託你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:03.25,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,真拿妳沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:05.52,Flashback,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,盯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.07,0:21:08.01,Flashback,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,盯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:11.10,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,哦 夾到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:12.07,Flashback,Aoi (Age 8),0,0,0,,太棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:13.33,High,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}好厲害！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.20,0:21:13.33,High-English,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.41,0:21:14.75,High,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}你好會玩遊戲！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.41,0:21:14.75,High-English,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}You are so good at games!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:16.46,High,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}這個角色叫什麼名字？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.75,0:21:16.46,High-English,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}What is this character called?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:19.58,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,咦？ 呃… 這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.58,0:21:21.48,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,Present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:27.53,Flashback,Aoi (Age 8),0,0,0,,喂！ 你幹嘛送給她啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.53,0:21:30.43,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,因為她用閃閃發光的眼神看著 我就忍不住…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.43,0:21:32.80,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,我再夾一個別的給妳嘛 葵衣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:34.39,Flashback,Aoi (Age 8),0,0,0,,那我要這隻貓咪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.39,0:21:36.25,Flashback,Renji (Age 13),0,0,0,,咦？ 不是無尾熊嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.25,0:21:36.98,High,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}謝謝你！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.25,0:21:36.98,High-English,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.05,0:21:40.82,High,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}我會好好珍惜它的！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.05,0:21:40.82,High-English,Lily (Age 8),0,0,0,,{\3c&H400000&\4c&H400000&}I'll take good care of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.13,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,再見！
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.13,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Alright, see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:53.30,Text,Oliver,0,0,0,,好喔
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.13,0:21:53.30,Text-English,Oliver,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:54.46,Text,Sheryl,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.30,0:21:54.46,Text-English,Sheryl,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.03,0:23:14.95,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,遊樂場…
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.03,0:23:14.95,Text-English,Lily,0,0,0,,Amusement arcade...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.78,0:23:17.96,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,遊樂場！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:24.95,Text,Lily,0,0,0,,Hi, Renji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.21,0:23:27.96,Top,Renji,0,0,0,,嗨 莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.80,High,Lily,0,0,0,,Come on, let's play together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.88,0:23:31.80,High,Lily,0,0,0,,來吧 我們一起玩！
Comment: 0,0:21:54.67,0:21:54.67,Default,OP,0,0,0,,-- OP --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.94,0:22:17.90,Title,OP,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,880)\fad(200,0)\fnNoto Sans CJK TC Black\fs150\3c&HFFFD7C&\t(0,500,\3c&HE68314&)\3a&H00&\bord8\shad0\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&}遊樂場少女的{\c&H32FFFE&}異文化{\c&HFFFFFF&}交流
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:22:01.13,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ねぇ　気づいてほしいの　あなたのハイスコア目指して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:05.68,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ハートと共にレベリング　ワクワクが止まらない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:06.56,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}(レッツゴー！)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:24.99,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}心がドキドキ　新しい恋の予感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:32.00,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}コインを片手に　おまじないと勇気を込めて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:40.51,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}コントローラー握るときみたいに(ゲーセンガール×2)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.51,0:22:44.34,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}手をつなげたらなんて思うの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:50.68,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}もっと近くで笑って(一緒に　レッツスタート！)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:56.94,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}お願い　この気持ち気づいて　あなたのハイスコア目指して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:23:01.32,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ハートと共にレベリング　ワクワクが止まらない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.32,0:23:02.32,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}(レッツゴー！)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:07.57,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}目が合った瞬間　ボーナスステージはじまるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:12.25,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}コンティニューできるなら　何回でも
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:17.83,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ゲームみたいにリセットできない
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:23.21,OPJP12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ゲームみたいな恋の始まり
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:22:01.13,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}吶 希望你能發現 我以你的最高分為目標
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:05.68,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}和心一起升級 這份悸動止不住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.68,0:22:06.56,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}（Let's go！）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:24.99,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}心兒怦然跳動 是全新戀愛的預感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:32.00,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}手握著代幣 注入咒語和勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:40.51,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}就像握著控制器的時候那樣（遊樂場少女×2）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.51,0:22:44.34,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}想著要是能牽起你的手就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:50.68,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}想要更靠近你一起歡笑（一起 Let's Start！）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:56.94,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}吶 希望你能發現 我以你的最高分為目標
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.94,0:23:01.32,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}和心一起升級 這份悸動止不住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.32,0:23:02.32,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}（Let's go！）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.32,0:23:07.57,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}目光交會的瞬間 就是獎勵關卡的開始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:12.25,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}如果可以繼續玩下去 就算重來幾次也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.45,0:23:17.83,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}就算戀情不像遊戲能讀檔重來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.83,0:23:23.21,OPCHT12,OP,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}也能像遊戲一樣就此開始
